      "GIULIA: That's just Signora Marsigliese. She works for the sponsor for the race. This is gonna take forever.\nSIGNORA MARSIGLIESE: The finest pasta in Liguria. At a price every family can afford!--\nSIGNORA MARSIGLIESE: Enthusiasm. Love to see it. To win my famous race, your team must be the first to: Brave the treacherous waters of the bay!! Devour a myster…",
